  "description": "Navigation for the thermal and power area, plus the collector contract for it: which trays are publishing hwmon temperature sensors, hwmon module power meters and the DCGM energy counter, and how stale the stalest sample is. The readings themselves live on the two boards linked at the top; this board only answers 'is the data trustworthy'.",
